      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 2.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.13,
      "end_seconds": 9.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "yes come in and sit down what brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.52,
      "end_seconds": 17.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "mainly I've been putting on weight over the years that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.31,
      "end_seconds": 22.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "When was the the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.58,
      "end_seconds": 29.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "it's been one week I'm fairly sure. Let me think I've also been snoring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.7,
      "end_seconds": 32.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.42,
      "end_seconds": 37.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm on telmisartan, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.44,
      "end_seconds": 41.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.59,
      "end_seconds": 47.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "40 milligrams I think that's what's on the box"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.93,
      "end_seconds": 57.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.92,
      "end_seconds": 62.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.36,
      "end_seconds": 65.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.58,
      "end_seconds": 70.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.22,
      "end_seconds": 73.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.27,
      "end_seconds": 83.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.04,
      "end_seconds": 87.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.99,
      "end_seconds": 92.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.72,
      "end_seconds": 115.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.38,
      "end_seconds": 124.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "uh, years back I got wheezing from diclofenac, so I stay away from it now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.11,
      "end_seconds": 127.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.17,
      "end_seconds": 142.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "I've, I've got high blood pressure. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.29,
      "end_seconds": 148.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.53,
      "end_seconds": 165.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "and what about high thirst, chest pain or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.39,
      "end_seconds": 169.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "no, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.76,
      "end_seconds": 171.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.9,
      "end_seconds": 174.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.71,
      "end_seconds": 178.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.83,
      "end_seconds": 192.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "That's it, just a a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.49,
      "end_seconds": 214.96,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "okay: pressure 165 over 93, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temp 36.5 degrees, pulse is 93 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.03,
      "end_seconds": 219.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.28,
      "end_seconds": 224.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.16,
      "end_seconds": 237.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Your weight and waist measurement are both above the healthy range."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.79,
      "end_seconds": 244.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "please sit back down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.28,
      "end_seconds": 267.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "let's book a thyroid test to look into weight gain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.53,
      "end_seconds": 270.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "that makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.89,
      "end_seconds": 282.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Let's get a cholesterol test, for obesity. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.2,
      "end_seconds": 286.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "is that that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.7,
      "end_seconds": 322.77,
      "duration_seconds": 34.07,
      "text": "aim for a loss of half a kilo a week with smaller portions and a daily thirty-minute walk. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'll also refer you to the weight management service. If the symptoms get worse that's the point to come in urgently. I'd like to see you again in three months. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.77,
      "end_seconds": 328.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "right, I'll do that thank you, doctor"
    }
  ]
}